# graf-ztk.prf -- stand-in tiles for ZangbandTK's own monsters.
#
# GENERATED by scripts/tiles/borrow-tiles.py.  Do not edit by hand:
# re-running the script overwrites this file.  Each line borrows the
# picture of an Angband monster sharing the same base, preferring one
# of the same colour and then the nearest depth.  The monster it was
# taken from is named in the comment so a wrong-looking tile can be
# traced without running anything.
#
# These are placeholders.  Replacing one with real art means deleting
# its line here and adding a proper mapping to graf-nmd.prf.
#
# Uniques are deliberately absent -- they render as text until they
# have art of their own, because a borrowed portrait on a named
# character says something false.

